      "google-site-verification": "Zs-p4U7VB60gcfgIDRRuxwgXbgBfuxz15-nJyzNf_n8",
      "title": "Winter Boot, a PHP 8 microservices framework inspired by Spring Boot, with attribute-driven DI, REST routing, AOP, async, and scheduling",
      "description": "Winter Boot is a modern PHP 8 microservices framework inspired by Spring Boot, bringing attribute-driven dependency injection, AOP, REST routing, async task execution, caching, transactions, and scheduling to the PHP ecosystem. Whether you are migrating from a Spring Boot project or starting fresh, this documentation covers everything you need to build, configure, and deploy production-ready PHP microservices."
    }
